Field Prefill Notes Day key current value text Facility name current value text; a note reads matched exactly, including capitalisation Tabs to watch §5's checkbox list pre-ticked per §5 Shared secret never prefilled hidden entirely when one is already stored, replaced by a Secret stored line and a Replace secret link that reveals the field <p><code>hasSecret</code> resolves through <code>readSharedSecret_()</code>, so a copy of the Master counts as already having one on the strength of §3.5's carrier alone. In practice the field is therefore hidden in every generated workbook and shown only in a hand-built one — the operator setting up a copy fills in day, venue and tabs, and is never asked for the secret.</p> <p>The dialog loads current state through one server call:</p> <pre><code>function getSyncSetupState() {
  const config = readSyncConfig_();
  return {
    dayKey: config ? config.dayKey : '',
    facilityName: config ? config.facilityName : '',
    hasSecret: !!readSharedSecret_(),
    tabs: listSheetTabs(),
    watchedGids: config ? config.watchedGids : [],
    defaultTabNames: [SCHEDULE_TAB_NAME, COURT_CONTROL_TAB_NAME]
  };
}
</code></pre> <p>When <code>watchedGids</code> is empty, tick the tabs named in <code>defaultTabNames</code>; otherwise tick whatever matches the stored GIDs.</p> <p>A stored secret is never returned to the client, displayed, or logged — only the <code>hasSecret</code> boolean crosses that boundary.</p>
